Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Vortex CAL energy: command stats, physical refresh, drain
 query

VxCmdStats (passive per-channel and per-pseudo-channel command counts,
PREA banks closed, minimum REF-to-ACT gap), VxPhysRefresh (all-bank
refresh per channel at a fractional physical interval, switchable off for
draining), and a vx_outstanding() drain query appended to
IDRAMController/IMemorySystem and implemented by the generic controller
and DRAM system.

